# Build output
bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.user

# Deobfuscated / decompiled game code and copied game binaries — NEVER commit.
# We ship no game code; this tree is a local analysis workspace only.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored "game/" also swallowed module/src/Game/
# (git on Windows matches ignore patterns case-insensitively).
/game/

# Local tool downloads (de4dot, etc.) live in the scratchpad, but guard anyway.
tools/de4dot/
*.nupkg

# Installer build tree and packaged releases (build-installer.ps1 / build_release.ps1 output).
installer/target/
releases/

# The rendered manual (mdbook build docs_src)
docs_src/book/
